    "content": "📊 STAT GRID OVERHAUL\nThe stat card grid on player profiles has been completely restructured into a clean 6×2 layout — all 12 cards always visible, with a dash shown when data is unavailable.\n• Removed redundant Avg Kills and Avg Deaths cards (already covered by KDA).\n• Replaced Avg Assists with Avg GPM for a more useful at-a-glance read.\n• Cards fill the full container width with consistent row heights.\n• MVP Wins and Attitude Rating cards are always shown regardless of data.\n\n📐 BENCHMARK SEASON FILTERING\nPlayer Benchmarks now correctly filters by the selected season. Fixed a ROUND::numeric cast error and a GROUP BY issue that caused incorrect averages. Stat cards align with the timeline section below for a balanced layout.\n\n🧹 UPLOAD NOTIFICATION REMOVED\nThe persistent replay upload notification bar has been removed from the global layout — it was cluttering every page and is no longer needed.",
