    "published_at": "2026-04-03",
    "content": "📬 RATING DM IMPROVEMENTS\nPost-match rating DMs sent to players have been significantly improved:\n• Match link now included in every DM so players can review the scoreboard before rating.\n• Opt-out footer added — players are reminded they can ignore the DM with no consequences.\n• 30-minute rating window is now clearly stated in the message.\n\n🗳️ MVP VOTE — FULL LOBBY\nThe MVP vote prompt now correctly shows all 9 opposing + same team players (both teams minus yourself). Previously it only showed a subset.\n\n📤 SEND MISSING DMs\nA new \"Send Missing DMs\" button has been added to the match admin panel. It sends rating DMs only to players who have never received one for that match — skipping anyone already DM'd. All sends are tracked in a match_dm_log table to prevent duplicates.\n\n🎯 ITEM & HERO NAME FIXES\n• Broken item icons fixed by normalising item names (underscores, casing).\n• Support item list trimmed to meaningful items: wards, smoke, dust, gem only.\n• Hero display names corrected — Shredder now shows as Timbersaw, and other outdated internal names are mapped to their current display names.",
