    "title": "TrueSkill 2 Admin Preview (Hidden)",
    "published_at": "2026-04-06",
    "content": "🔬 TRUESKILL 2 SIMULATION — ADMIN ONLY\nA hidden TrueSkill 2 simulation is now accessible from the Admin Panel via the \"Run TS2 Simulation\" button.\n\nHow it works:\n• Reruns the entire match history under a TS2 variant where μ updates are scaled by each player's per-match K/D/A performance (modifier range: 0.65× to 1.35×, z-scored within the match).\n• σ (uncertainty) is unchanged from standard TrueSkill.\n• Results are displayed in the admin panel for comparison against the current TrueSkill ratings.\n• Read-only — nothing is written to the database. Used to evaluate TS2 before a potential Season 10 rollout.",
