    "published_at": "2026-04-07",
    "content": "📅 SCHEDULE & RSVP IMPROVEMENTS\nThe game scheduling system has been overhauled for reliability and usability:\n• Schedule and RSVP messages are now combined into a single clean Discord post instead of two separate messages.\n• Discord scheduling notifications fire correctly on game creation and updates.\n• Improved user registration checks with clearer error messages.\n\n🔗 STEAM ACCOUNT LINKING PROMPT\nWhen a player RSVPs to a game without a linked Steam account, the bot now sends them a personalised prompt explaining how to link their Steam ID — so they don't miss out on Steam chat reminders and lobby invites.\n\n🛡️ STEAM ID VALIDATION\nRobust Steam ID validation added across registration and lobby invite flows — accepts Steam64, Steam2, Steam3, and profile URL formats and converts them correctly. A !testdm and !testrsvpdm admin command pair is available for testing the DM flows without a real match.",
