    "title": "Lobby Auto-Create, Auto-Invite & !start_game",
    "published_at": "2026-04-08",
    "content": "🎮 LOBBY AUTO-CREATE AT GAME TIME\nThe bot now monitors the schedule and automatically creates a Dota 2 practice lobby when a scheduled game's start time arrives — no admin action required.\n• Lobby named \"OCE Inhouse #N\" based on the game number.\n• Password carried over from the scheduled game if one was set.\n• All RSVPd players with a linked Steam account receive a GC lobby invite automatically (0.5s between each to avoid rate limits).\n• A formatted Discord announcement is posted confirming the lobby is live and how many invites were sent.\n• Lobby is marked in the database so it's never auto-created twice.\n• Bot immediately moves to the broadcast slot after creation — all 10 player seats remain free.\n\n🟢 10-PLAYER SEATED NOTIFICATION\nWhen the 10th player sits on Radiant or Dire, the bot posts to the announcements channel confirming the lobby is full.\n\n🕹️ !start_game COMMAND\nNew admin Discord command. Force-launches the active lobby regardless of player count. Cancels any active countdown before launching.",
